Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Pods Not Getting Sidecar Injection
Problem: Pods don't have the istio-proxy sidecar container.

Solution:

# Verify namespace labeling
oc get namespace bookinfo-microservices --show-labels

# Re-label if necessary
oc label namespace bookinfo-microservices istio-injection=enabled --overwrite

# Restart deployments to trigger injection
oc rollout restart deployment -n bookinfo-microservices
Issue 2: Services Not Communicating
Problem: Services cannot reach each other.

Solution:

# Check service endpoints
oc get endpoints -n bookinfo-microservices

# Verify DNS resolution
oc exec -n bookinfo-microservices $PRODUCTPAGE_POD -c productpage -- nslookup reviews

# Check network policies
oc get networkpolicies -n bookinfo-microservices
Issue 3: Gateway Not Accessible
Problem: Cannot access the application through the gateway.

Solution:

# Verify gateway configuration
oc get gateway -n bookinfo-microservices bookinfo-gateway -o yaml

# Check ingress gateway status
oc get pods -n istio-system -l app=istio-ingressgateway

# Verify route exists
oc get route -n istio-system
